<p>Former Brazilian President Jair Bolsonaro was admitted to the intensive care unit at DF Star hospital in Brasília after falling ill. Doctors said he had pneumonia.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/KtFOaA36cMlMN4ckBACPYDW43td4OcHjIi-6T6fjhond7z60qF4ayWyJxupM_tMHq1tMtrB23AMsogb3GIAb8ryVTXg0RIsSw1w5KRMjU4acTNuMKE4ow3XrRyRcA8ePv2zjsDyTdHjaRLqje3lqRF7nwiBQB_bwYgmfXxzyXw' alt='Image accompanying coverage of former Brazilian President Jair Bolsonaro’s hospitalization in Brasília.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Reports differed on Bolsonaro’s symptoms. SCMP highlighted chills and vomiting, while Straits Times and MercoPress also cited fever and low oxygen saturation; MercoPress added sweating.</li><li>DF Star hospital used more specific language, saying tests confirmed bilateral bacterial bronchopneumonia, while other reports described the condition more broadly as pneumonia.</li><li>SCMP framed the illness against Brazil’s political backdrop, noting that Bolsonaro has said he would run for president this year and that recent polls place him alongside President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva.</li></ul><blockquote>I ask for prayers that it not be anything serious - Flavio Bolsonaro</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>DF Star hospital: The hospital said it moved Bolsonaro to intensive care after tests confirmed bilateral bacterial bronchopneumonia. He was receiving intravenous antibiotics and non-invasive support. (<a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/03/14/bolsonaro-moved-to-intensive-care-with-bronchopneumonia-as-family-renews-house-arrest-plea'>MercoPress</a>)</li><li>Flavio Bolsonaro: Bolsonaro’s eldest son publicly asked for prayers, saying he hoped the episode would not be serious. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3346564/brazils-jair-bolsonaro-icu-pneumonia'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Bolsonaro family: The family renewed its plea for house arrest while Bolsonaro received treatment in hospital. (<a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/03/14/bolsonaro-moved-to-intensive-care-with-bronchopneumonia-as-family-renews-house-arrest-plea'>MercoPress</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/brazils-president-bolsonaro-intensive-care-pneumonia-hospital-131044612'>Brazil’s ex-President Bolsonaro is in intensive care with pneumonia, hospital says</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3346564/brazils-jair-bolsonaro-icu-pneumonia'>Brazil’s Jair Bolsonaro in ICU with pneumonia</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/brazils-jailed-ex-president-bolsonaro-hospitalized-in-icu-with-pneumonia'>Brazil’s jailed ex-president Jair Bolsonaro hospitalised in ICU with pneumonia</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/03/14/bolsonaro-moved-to-intensive-care-with-bronchopneumonia-as-family-renews-house-arrest-plea'>Bolsonaro moved to intensive care with bronchopneumonia as family renews house arrest plea</a> - mercopress.com</li></ul>